# Terraform / OpenTofu
# State holds resource attributes in the clear and tfvars holds identifying
# values (an operator IP, an alert address). The .lock.hcl is deliberately NOT
# ignored — provider version pinning belongs in the repo.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log

